  "html": "<h1 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 22px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>生态硬件接口</strong></span></h1><h2 style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>1. 资源入口</strong></span></h2><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(100, 106, 115); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">为帮助智能硬件开发者快速接入比亚迪AIoT生态，我们提供完整的硬件接口规范文档，涵盖</span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">螺纹生态接口（供电）、椅背生态接口、中控生态接口</span><span style=\"color: rgb(100, 106, 115); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">，及面向生态硬件接口外接件的一般约束，如下图 1-1。开发者完成企业实名认证并签署《比亚迪AIoT业务服务协议》后，可前往【</span><a href=\"#/researchTools/IoTHardwareInterface\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">管理中心-生态硬件接口</span></a><span style=\"color: rgb(100, 106, 115); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">】获取详细技术资料。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/ac5836d9969d426d9b4118d2bdfbd554.jpg?auth_key=1795675071-8f9eaaf687534f389bb2a9120341cae1-0-21aabedfefbdeea21a67ed90e14a7fc7037bbd11ceb58d8776d422286824b30c\" alt=\"布局2 - 副本.jpg\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 1048.84px;height: 465.45px;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(100, 106, 115); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图 1-1 硬件接口规范目录</span></p><h2 style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>2. 生态硬件接口简介</strong></span></h2><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">生态硬件接口作为汽车智慧座舱实现硬件即插即用、场景按需组合、生态开放增值的核心技术载体，依据车规级可靠性、EMC兼容性及模块化拓展要求，基于机械-电气分层解耦、多接口协同工作的设计原则，明确</span><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>螺纹生态接口（供电）、椅背生态接口、中控生态接口</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">的结构安装、供电能力、通讯方式、电气接口、注意事项，构建起固定-快拆-盲插的全场景连接能力体系，推动座舱硬件向车规级模块化、灵活拓展的技术架构升级，最终支撑个性化座舱场景定制、第三方生态资源接入与商业价值增值的全业务闭环。</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">如您已经完成企业实名认证并签署</span><span style=\"color: rgb(100, 106, 115); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">《比亚迪AIoT业务服务协议》，可</span><a href=\"#/researchTools/protocolDetail?id=289\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">点击这里</span></a><span style=\"color: rgb(100, 106, 115); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">获取资料详情。下图是生态硬件接口和部分外接件的示意图，详细资料请前往【</span><a href=\"#/researchTools/IoTHardwareInterface\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">管理中心-生态硬件接口</span></a><span style=\"color: rgb(100, 106, 115); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">】获取。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/ecf2770142684c4e8973fffc0278028e.jpg?auth_key=1795675071-419bdefb9ec24389b1a151b9ce3c4abc-0-2e17d1b464e99358903a2228f89f220db32e42c7bf6994f49435a860993ab0c5\" alt=\"接口2.jpg\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 1032.92px;height: 640.23px;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(100, 106, 115); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图 2-1 螺纹生态接口（供电）</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/5bbef20a3e304eef979c2a7072b03e1c.png?auth_key=1795675071-0002b8e04725447793d666e2aff6b058-0-1cdd3ca41e6a35b95f847dbf1b040345ad47ebc9e0b19a0c50bc22b09ceb19a2\" alt=\"image.png\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 1022.99px;height: 647.05px;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(100, 106, 115); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图 2-2 椅背生态接口</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/39cfa7c9cd3c411abec9a9723247c46b.jpg?auth_key=1795675071-9d3bfba2e0c7442eb1cf4c1db1b1006e-0-fecd8dddea62ec631722c01af9380daf365480cade6d21cf918cc912711ad27d\" alt=\"84604021357fedd60970d6f359d1e584_compress.jpg\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 1017.97px;height: 1017.97px;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(100, 106, 115); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图 2-3 中控生态接口</span></p><table style=\"width: auto;table-layout: fixed;height:530\"><colgroup contentEditable=\"false\"><col width=462></col><col width=466></col><col width=465></col></colgroup><tbody><tr style=\"height: 421px\"><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><br></span><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/d186558b4be24ddd90362b5e6133ba5e.jpg?auth_key=1795675071-1c0286e88b3e471192b60438d83085e9-0-d1f8f83765972f07d6065271459e849fc84075cae75cf99e5df0379b7e830351\" alt=\"4cc341048fd48bc960a82d106f7d0cff_compress.jpg\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图 2-4 中控生态接口外接件1</span></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><br></span><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/64e11d000abe4593b16a388111fe6bac.jpg?auth_key=1795675071-ac8dc346cc7345a2a1395b20e216a69d-0-e803a8b23b98c3857b9b9773bf6728ad6167952f37e1dd5db8a9f9f89c5abc98\" alt=\"917b5d3febead827e65b04500f9d8560_compress.jpg\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图 2-4 中控生态接口外接件2</span></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><br><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/1896ebbbd362431296d1d65d0f826b33.jpg?auth_key=1795675071-77be6de6f0244a49928e32ce6b5642e4-0-01f5868908717af045aafbe053096514e3077c3c3e06e11bdb87ee0437c87f68\" alt=\"e430be597816625660d82a0f20544246_compress.jpg\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图 2-4 中控生态接口外接件3</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><br></p>"
